      <value>&lt;- This square is WS2812 8x8 Matrix Check on orientation before screwing it all together. Several types are available. This sizing fits 66x65 type. There is a flexible type which is a little larger and the LEDs are addressed in a slightly different pattern. Code for both is provided. I put a couple of layers of self adhesive foam which raised the LED matrix up so that it pressed against the acrylic front panel.</value>
